    "detailed_description": "Rise up with 1\u20134 players in chaotic couch co-op to restore a fallen nation! \u26cf\ufe0f Work as a team to gather materials, \ud83e\uddf1 piece the wall together, and \u2694\ufe0f defend against ambushes. Play mini-games to help your local townsfolk reclaim their homes \ud83c\udfe0. Raise an army to take back your city! Inspired by the Biblical story of Nehemiah.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chaotic local multiplayer with up to 4 friends!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816510/extras/e3fc247ac35c789e4cd5910df13cd6c5.poster.avif?t=1715669023\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816510/extras/e3fc247ac35c789e4cd5910df13cd6c5.webm?t=1715669023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816510/extras/e3fc247ac35c789e4cd5910df13cd6c5.mp4?t=1715669023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>There's lots to do to rebuild a city. Bring your friends along to help out.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather materials!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816510/extras/dc6798614b1d7cb8edbce981cb43bab8.poster.avif?t=1715669023\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816510/extras/dc6798614b1d7cb8edbce981cb43bab8.webm?t=1715669023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816510/extras/dc6798614b1d7cb8edbce981cb43bab8.mp4?t=1715669023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Chop, mine, and gather materials to rebuild.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rebuild the Wall!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816510/extras/940eed99878a049f93eb949bcea86b6e.poster.avif?t=1715669023\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816510/extras/940eed99878a049f93eb949bcea86b6e.webm?t=1715669023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816510/extras/940eed99878a049f93eb949bcea86b6e.mp4?t=1715669023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Teamwork makes the dream work! Toss around chunks of wall, weapons, or players.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit and raise an army!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816510/extras/4c6f003182895f84901c58dbdde79e4f.poster.avif?t=1715669023\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816510/extras/4c6f003182895f84901c58dbdde79e4f.webm?t=1715669023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816510/extras/4c6f003182895f84901c58dbdde79e4f.mp4?t=1715669023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>By helping villagers, you can call for their aid in battle! That is, if you can find the horn.",
